        "url": "https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1953-01-22/pdf/FR-1953-01-22.pdf"
      },
      "text": "By virtue of the authority vested in  \nme as President of the United States and \nas Commander in Chief of the armed  \nforces of the United States, it is hereby  \nordered as follows;"
    },
    {
      "char_end": 1851,
      "char_start": 1578,
      "id": "CLAUSES:EO:10431#1",
      "kind": "item",
      "label": "1 .",
      "pdf_page": 1,
      "scope_id": "EO:10431#1",
      "source": {
        "filing_date": null,
        "location_confidence": "high",
        "location_verified": false,
        "page_or_item": "18 FR 437, PDF pages 1-3",
        "requires_page_check": false,
        "sha256": "ec0ea29a115215d25562478504b35ef7665d5a8fc21e2fb37099d70b0e5c17f8",
        "signing_date": "1953-01-19",
        "text_path": "jobs/fr-originals/data/full_run/texts/EO_10431.txt",
        "text_sha256": "c66347e9ecca5e39c40d13137e73024b32007563a24a582e0772f2a443337feb",
        "url": "https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1953-01-22/pdf/FR-1953-01-22.pdf"
      },
      "text": "1 . There is hereby established a medal \nto be known as the National Security  \nMedal with accompanying ribbons and  \nappurtenances. The medal and* its ap­\npurtenances shall be of appropriate de­\nsign, approved by the Executive Secre­\ntary of the National Security Council."
    },
    {
      "char_end": 2166,
      "char_start": 1852,
      "id": "CLAUSES:EO:10431#2",
      "kind": "item",
      "label": "2 .",
      "pdf_page": 1,
      "scope_id": "EO:10431#2",
      "source": {
        "filing_date": null,
        "location_confidence": "high",
        "location_verified": false,
        "page_or_item": "18 FR 437, PDF pages 1-3",
        "requires_page_check": false,
        "sha256": "ec0ea29a115215d25562478504b35ef7665d5a8fc21e2fb37099d70b0e5c17f8",
        "signing_date": "1953-01-19",
        "text_path": "jobs/fr-originals/data/full_run/texts/EO_10431.txt",
        "text_sha256": "c66347e9ecca5e39c40d13137e73024b32007563a24a582e0772f2a443337feb",
        "url": "https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1953-01-22/pdf/FR-1953-01-22.pdf"
      },
      "text": "2 . The National Security Medal may  \nbe awarded to any person, without re­\ngard to nationality, including members  \nor the armed forces of the United States, \nfor distinguished achievement or out­\nstanding contribution on or after July  \n26, 1947, in the field of intelligence re­\nlating to the national security."
    },
    {
      "char_end": 2556,
      "char_start": 2167,
      "id": "CLAUSES:EO:10431#3",
      "kind": "item",
      "label": "3 .",
      "pdf_page": 1,
      "scope_id": "EO:10431#3",
      "source": {
        "filing_date": null,
        "location_confidence": "high",
        "location_verified": false,
        "page_or_item": "18 FR 437, PDF pages 1-3",
        "requires_page_check": false,
        "sha256": "ec0ea29a115215d25562478504b35ef7665d5a8fc21e2fb37099d70b0e5c17f8",
        "signing_date": "1953-01-19",
        "text_path": "jobs/fr-originals/data/full_run/texts/EO_10431.txt",
        "text_sha256": "c66347e9ecca5e39c40d13137e73024b32007563a24a582e0772f2a443337feb",
        "url": "https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1953-01-22/pdf/FR-1953-01-22.pdf"
      },
      "text": "3 . The decoration established by this  \norder shall be awarded by the President  \nof the United States or, under regula­\ntions approved by him, by such person  \nor persons as he may designate.\n4 - No more than one National Security \nMedal shall be awarded to any one per­\nson, but for subsequent services justify­\ning an award, a suitable device may be \nawarded to be worn with the Medal."
    },
    {
